#. ja: 私とアヴィールを祝福するために<br>みんなが 贈物を持ってきてくれたのよ
#. de: Sieh nur, Avere! All diese Leute sind gekommen, um dir ihre Seele zu schenken! Ist das nicht nett von ihnen?
#. fr: Tous nos amis sont venus nous apporter des cadeaux pour célébrer notre bonheur, à Avere et à moi<nbsp>!
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonTamtara_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONTAMTARA_00000_EDDA_000_000:1"
msgid "Look, Avere! All these people have come to make you a gift of their souls! Isn't that kind of them?"
msgstr "Смотри, Авер! Все эти люди пришли преподнести тебе свои души! Разве не мило с их стороны?"

#. ja: あなたが気にかけていた冒険者も<br>ほら とっておきの身体を 持ってきてくれたわ！
#. de: Sogar <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> ist hier! Nun ist dein Traum, so wie <if $gn4>sie<else>er</if> zu werden, zum Greifen nah!
#. fr: Il y a même cet<if $gn4>te</if> aventuri<if $gn4>ère<else>er</if> qui avait voulu t'aider, regarde<nbsp>!<br><if $gn4>Elle<else>Il</if> va t'apporter un corps de rechange<nbsp>!
#. macro: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split> — the first name of the player character (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonTamtara_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONTAMTARA_00000_EDDA_000_001:1"
msgid "Even <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> is here! Now your dream of becoming like <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> can come true!"
msgstr "Даже <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> здесь! Теперь твоя мечта стать похожей на <if $gn4>неё<else>него</if> может сбыться!"

#. ja: そんな なんてこと……<br>あぁ…… アヴィール……アヴィール……！
#. de: Was ... Was hast du getan? Aveeere! Neeein!
#. fr: Non... C'est impossible... Avere...<nbsp>!
msgctxt "dungeon/000/DungeonTamtara_00000:TEXT_DUNGEONTAMTARA_00000_EDDA_000_010:1"
msgid "What...what have you done? Aveeerrreee! Noooooo!"
msgstr "Что... что ты наделал? Аве-е-ер! Не-е-ет!"

